{"regions":[{"id":"LR-CM","name":"大角山县","english":"Grand Cape Mount","country":"LBR","lat":7.09577,"lon":-10.9953,"kind":"region","bbox":[-11.4762,6.5925,-10.5199,7.5437],"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-11.4762,6.9194],[-11.4367,6.9385],[-11.3897,7.0735],[-11.3551,7.0841],[-11.3732,7.1388],[-11.3172,7.2136],[-11.2179,7.2541],[-11.1263,7.368],[-10.937,7.5078],[-10.864,7.5437],[-10.6056,7.4884],[-10.5258,7.3915],[-10.5199,7.2967],[-10.7024,7.1934],[-10.9436,7.0054],[-10.9737,6.7282],[-11.0694,6.6449],[-11.0771,6.5925],[-11.3532,6.7012],[-11.3819,6.8368],[-11.4762,6.9194]]]},"knowledge":{"theme":"大角山县 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"该县西部的沿海平原海拔高达 30 米（98 英尺），向内延伸 25 公里（16 英里）。\n这些平原的降雨量非常大，每年从 4,450 毫米到 4,500 毫米不等，日照时间充足，湿度为 85% 到 95%。\n沿着河流和小溪是沼泽地，同时还有大片的热带草原林地。","culture":"300英尺（约83.6米）高的海角山成为该地区定居者的地标， 西奥多·卡诺 (Theodore Canot) 于 1840 年建立了这个定居点。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1047921","articleTitle":"大角山县","sourceRevision":84894761,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 大角山县","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%92%E5%B1%B1%E5%8E%BF"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84894761"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1047921"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"LR-X1~","name":"巴波卢县","english":"Gbapolu","country":"LBR","lat":7.51706,"lon":-10.1841,"kind":"region","bbox":[-10.9465,6.8158,-9.6848,8.0225],"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-10.864,7.5437],[-10.7306,7.7055],[-10.6152,7.769],[-10.6162,8.0225],[-10.5648,7.9783],[-10.4645,8.0043],[-10.4088,7.9523],[-10.2269,7.8967],[-10.2009,7.9337],[-10.1081,7.8038],[-9.9484,7.8409],[-9.6959,7.737],[-9.6848,7.6701],[-9.8333,7.3285],[-9.8273,7.1982],[-10.0955,7.0421],[-10.112,7.1228],[-10.1977,7.1339],[-10.3442,6.9826],